# Comprehensive DSL Test - All Stages
# Tests features from Stages 1, 2, and 3 combined

mode continue

log ========================================
log   UniControl Comprehensive Test Suite
log ========================================

# Stage 1: Extended DSL Operations
log
log === Stage 1: Extended DSL Operations ===

log 1.1: Launch and basic operations
launch Calculator
wait 2

log 1.2: Click operations
find 4
click
wait 0.3

find 2
click
wait 0.3

log 1.3: Focus action
find Equals role: AXButton
focus
wait 0.3
click
wait 0.5

log 1.4: Keyboard shortcuts
pressKey Cmd+C
wait 0.5

log 1.5: Clear with keyboard
pressKey Cmd+Backspace
wait 0.5

# Stage 2: Error Handling & Debugging
log
log === Stage 2: Error Handling & Debugging ===

log 2.1: Test error logging (continue mode)
find NonExistentElement
# Should log error but continue

log 2.2: Test with correct element after error
find 1
click
wait 0.3

find 0
click
wait 0.5

log 2.3: Test suggestion engine
find Cientific
# Should show suggestions for "Scientific"

log 2.4: Multiple operations with some failures
find Add role: AXButton
click
wait 0.3

find InvalidButton
click
# Should fail but continue

find 5
click
wait 0.3

find Equals role: AXButton
click
wait 1

# Stage 3: Vision Fallback (will try if AX fails)
log
log === Stage 3: Vision Fallback Ready ===
log Vision fallback will automatically activate if AX fails
log (requires macOS 12.3+ and Screen Recording permissions)

# Test TextEdit for more complex scenarios
log
log === TextEdit Integration Test ===

launch TextEdit
wait 2

log Type in text area
find role: AXTextArea
click
wait 0.5

type Testing UniControl with all three stages!
wait 1

log Select all and copy
pressKey Cmd+A
wait 0.5
pressKey Cmd+C
wait 0.5

log New document
pressKey Cmd+N
wait 1

log Paste
pressKey Cmd+V
wait 1

log
log ========================================
log   Test Suite Complete
log ========================================
log Check summary for any errors
